# Line-ending pins for reproducible SHA-256 integrity records.
#
# The frozen freeze and commitment records in this repository were computed
# from working-tree bytes that mix LF and CRLF per file (verified 2026-08-07).
# Every file covered by a hash record is pinned below to the exact
# representation the record was computed from, so a fresh clone on any
# platform reproduces identical bytes. Files without hash records follow
# `* text=auto`.

* text=auto

